Short summary in imperative mood

Explain why this change is being made. 

Explain what changed. Focus on high-level architecture, not line-by-line details (the diff shows that). Mention any trade-offs made.

# Commit Message Guidelines:
# 1. Subject: Imperative mood ("Add feature" not "Added" or "Adds")
# 2. Subject: 50 characters max, no trailing period.
# 3. Body: Wrap at 72 characters.
# 4. Separate subject from body with a blank line.
